// Poison counters ([CR#122.1f]): PLAYER-borne — the one carrier-scope column
// the registry row must carry ("a player is 'poisoned' if they have one or
// more"). The ten-poison loss is a standing state-based action ([CR#704.5c]),
// engine rules machinery — not a conferred property of the counter kind, so
// `confers` stays empty like the other marker counters.
CounterKind(
    name: "poison",
    params: [],
    spelling: "poison",
    grammar: FixedTerm(surface: "poison"),
    body: Counter(kind: Named(label: "Poison"), holder: Player, confers: []),
)
